{"page":217,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:71","surah":10,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱتْلُ عَلَيْهِمْ نَبَأَ نُوحٍ إِذْ قَالَ لِقَوْمِهِۦ يَـٰقَوْمِ إِن كَانَ كَبُرَ عَلَيْكُم مَّقَامِى وَتَذْكِيرِى بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ فَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ فَأَجْمِعُوٓا۟ أَمْرَكُمْ وَشُرَكَآءَكُمْ ثُمَّ لَا يَكُنْ أَمْرُكُمْ عَلَيْكُمْ غُمَّةً ثُمَّ ٱقْضُوٓا۟ إِلَىَّ وَلَا تُنظِرُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Tell them the story of Noah. He said to his people, ‘My people, if my presence among you and my reminding you of God’s signs is too much for you, then I put my trust in God. Agree on your course of action, you and your partner-gods- do not be hesitant or secretive about it- then carry out your decision on me and give me no respite.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱتْلُ","en_gloss":"And recite","transliteration":"wa-ut'lu","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَبَأَ","en_gloss":"the news","transliteration":"naba-a","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نُوحٍ","en_gloss":"(of) Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِقَوْمِهِۦ","en_gloss":"to his people","transliteration":"liqawmihi","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَبُرَ","en_gloss":"hard","transliteration":"kabura","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّقَامِى","en_gloss":"my stay","transliteration":"maqāmī","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَتَذْكِيرِى","en_gloss":"and my reminding","transliteration":"watadhkīrī","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs of Allah","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"the Signs of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَعَلَى","en_gloss":"then on","transliteration":"faʿalā","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تَوَكَّلْتُ","en_gloss":"I put my trust","transliteration":"tawakkaltu","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَأَجْمِعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"So you all resolve","transliteration":"fa-ajmiʿū","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَمْرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your plan","transliteration":"amrakum","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَشُرَكَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your partners","transliteration":"washurakāakum","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":24,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"let not be","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":25,"ar":"يَكُنْ","en_gloss":"let not be","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَمْرُكُمْ","en_gloss":"(in) your plan","transliteration":"amrukum","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":27,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":28,"ar":"غُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"any doubt","transliteration":"ghummatan","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":29,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱقْضُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"carry (it out)","transliteration":"iq'ḍū","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":31,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"upon me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":32,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":33,"ar":"تُنظِرُونِ","en_gloss":"give me respite","transliteration":"tunẓirūni","verse_key":"10:71"},{"pos":34,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:71"}]},{"verse_key":"10:72","surah":10,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن تَوَلَّيْتُمْ فَمَا سَأَلْتُكُم مِّنْ أَجْرٍ ۖ إِنْ أَجْرِىَ إِلَّا عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَأُمِرْتُ أَنْ أَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if you turn away, I have asked no reward from you; my reward is with God alone, and I am commanded to be one of those who devote themselves to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَوَلَّيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tawallaytum","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَأَلْتُكُم","en_gloss":"I have asked you","transliteration":"sa-altukum","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَجْرٍ ۖ","en_gloss":"reward","transliteration":"ajrin","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَجْرِىَ","en_gloss":"(is) my reward","transliteration":"ajriya","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأُمِرْتُ","en_gloss":"and I have been commanded","transliteration":"wa-umir'tu","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَكُونَ","en_gloss":"I be","transliteration":"akūna","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the Muslims","transliteration":"l-mus'limīna","verse_key":"10:72"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:72"}]},{"verse_key":"10:73","surah":10,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥ فِى ٱلْفُلْكِ وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ خَلَـٰٓئِفَ وَأَغْرَقْنَا ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ۖ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But they rejected him. We saved him and those with him on the Ark and let them survive; and We drowned those who denied Our revelations- see what was the end of those who were forewarned!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","en_gloss":"But they denied him","transliteration":"fakadhabūhu","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"so We saved him","transliteration":"fanajjaynāhu","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and (those) who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(were) with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكِ","en_gloss":"the ship","transliteration":"l-ful'ki","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We made them","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhum","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَلَـٰٓئِفَ","en_gloss":"successors","transliteration":"khalāifa","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَغْرَقْنَا","en_gloss":"and We drowned","transliteration":"wa-aghraqnā","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ۖ","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَٱنظُرْ","en_gloss":"Then see","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who were warned","transliteration":"l-mundharīna","verse_key":"10:73"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:73"}]},{"verse_key":"10:74","surah":10,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ بَعَثْنَا مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ رُسُلًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِمْ فَجَآءُوهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَمَا كَانُوا۟ لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِمَا كَذَّبُوا۟ بِهِۦ مِن قَبْلُ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَطْبَعُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِ ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then, after him, We sent messengers to their peoples bringing them clear signs. But they would not believe in anything they had already rejected: in this way We seal the hearts of those who are full of hostility.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَعَثْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"baʿathnā","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"after him","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلًا","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulan","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their people","transliteration":"qawmihim","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَجَآءُوهُم","en_gloss":"and they came to them","transliteration":"fajāūhum","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"10:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِيُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"to believe","transliteration":"liyu'm